module Core

### Represents the aggregate protocol for tagged-union variant types.
### `VariantType` identifies sum types whose value is one of a fixed set of member types,
### discriminated by the stored type tag. Like `RecordType`, it bundles only AUTO-DERIVED
### capabilities (`Diagnosable`, `Serializable`) — never hand-written promises such as
### `Equatable`/`Hashable`, which would leave an abstract method behind for constrained generics.
protocol VariantType obeys Diagnosable, Serializable
  pass
